        "raw": "<p>Oh, and the list of Scenarios came out&nbsp;<em>great</em>:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hematite Storm<br />\r\nEnraged Demons<br />\r\nDark Force<br />\r\nDrowning Earth<br />\r\nShadow Demon<br />\r\nVicious Demon<br />\r\nSearing Demons<br />\r\nHellfire<br />\r\nA Soul Bound<br />\r\nVampire<br />\r\nTombstone<br />\r\nThe Dark Dimension<br />\r\nThe Great Forest<br />\r\nIn the Dark<br />\r\nInexorable Force<br />\r\nThe Dark Dimension<br />\r\nHell's Edge<br />\r\nAscendant Land<br />\r\nBlistering Hell<br />\r\nDemon's Realm<br />\r\nChaos Realm<br />\r\nDestructive Chaos<br />\r\nScythe of the Black Flame<br />\r\nEtcher's Eye<br />\r\nAscending Dark<br />\r\nInheritance, Wrath, and Chaos<br />\r\nThe Great Ocean<br />\r\nAscending Dark<br />\r\nAncestral Realm<br />\r\nDark Realm<br />\r\nHell's Edge<br />\r\nThe Great Forest<br />\r\nLava Sea<br />\r\nThe Great Forest<br />\r\nFire Hell's Edge<br />\r\nThe World from Beyond<br />\r\nThe Great Forest<br />\r\nWarp Storm<br />\r\nBolster the Alliance<br />\r\nAscending Hell's Edge<br />\r\nCurse of Eternity<br />\r\nDestructive Chaos<br />\r\nDivide, Sustain, and Conquer<br />\r\nInexorable Darkness<br />\r\nCurse of the Fallen Throne<br />\r\nHell</p>",
